1829.patch","merged_at":"2026-07-28T14:42:09Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThis issue has been lingering since previous versions, where solid_angle_texel multiplies by the resolution of the mipmap instead of the source image resolution. NVIDIA's article [GPU Gems 3](https://developer.nvidia.com/gpugems/gpugems3/part-iii-rendering/chapter-20-gpu-based-importance-sampling) explains this in Equation 12 \"Here is how we proceed. First, we need to compute the number of environment map pixels in s . This number is given by the ratio of s to the solid angle subtended by one pixel of the zeroth mipmap level p , which in turn, is given by the texture resolution, w · h, and the mapping distortion factor d(u):\"\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nHere are some comparisons showing a massive reduction in undersampling artifacts.\r\n\r\n**No Array reflections with a radiance size of 2048**\r\n|Before|After|\r\n|--------|--------|\r\n|<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"before\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7fc7975b-6af2-45b0-b97c-3cbdec3d0769\" />|<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"after\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/352b4a9b-d83a-4dd7-9db8-442592ec1f3b\" />|\r\n\r\n**Reflections from the reflection probe with a default size**\r\n|Before|After|\r\n|--------|--------|\r\n|<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"before\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3179f62a-e7db-4612-aadf-5398f4288d3d\" />|<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"after\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6002bb22-fa23-402c-adb4-289450d2dd12\" />|","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121829/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121829/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}